# Pulumi Configuration Standards

## Project Layout
```
{{ORCHESTRATION_DIR}}/{stack-name}/
  Pulumi.yaml                  # Project metadata
  Pulumi.{environment}.yaml    # Stack-specific config (committed, non-secret values)
  {{ENTRY_POINT}}              # Main program entry point
  {{SHARED_COMPONENTS_DIR}}/   # Shared ComponentResource classes
  requirements.txt / package.json
```

## Stack Config Pattern (`Pulumi.{env}.yaml`)
```yaml
config:
  {{PULUMI_NAMESPACE}}:environment: "{{ENVIRONMENT}}"
  {{PULUMI_NAMESPACE}}:location: "{{LOCATION}}"
  {{PULUMI_NAMESPACE}}:prefix: "{{PREFIX}}"
  # Secrets are encrypted — set with: pulumi config set --secret key value
  # They appear as: key: secure: <ciphertext>
```

