## Deployment Commands
- Preview: `pulumi preview --stack {{ENVIRONMENT}}`
- Deploy: `pulumi up --stack {{ENVIRONMENT}} --yes` (always preview first)
- Destroy: `pulumi destroy --stack {{ENVIRONMENT}}` (requires explicit approval)
- Refresh: `pulumi refresh --stack {{ENVIRONMENT}}` (sync state with cloud)
